  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 1, 'Step outside for a minute, say a quiet hello to your street, and notice one thing you like about it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 2, 'Think of one person who has lived near you longer than you have, and simply smile or wave next time you see them.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 3, 'Look up your nearest public library''s hours and see whether it has a local history room or collection.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 4, 'Notice one small detail in your home today, like a light switch or a window latch, that hints at how old it is.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 5, 'Tell a friend or family member one thing you love about the place where you live, old or new.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 6, 'Look up how your street got its name, using your library''s local history page or a free online search.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 7, 'Ask an older neighbor what your street looked like when they first moved in.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 8, 'Ask a librarian at the front desk where you can find books about the history of your town or city.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 9, 'Find out what year your home or apartment building was built, from your paperwork or a quick question to the landlord.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 10, 'Share an interesting fact about your street with a neighbor when you see them outside.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 11, 'Walk one block this morning and look for a date carved above a doorway or set into a cornerstone.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 12, 'Find out which Native peoples lived on the land where your home stands, using a free online map or your library.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 13, 'Borrow one book about your area''s past and read just the first few pages tonight before bed.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 14, 'Ask your landlord or building manager what they know about the building''s history.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 15, 'Text a friend an old photo of your town and ask what they notice first.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 16, 'Stop at the nearest historical plaque or marker to your home and read every word on it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 17, 'Learn the name those first peoples used for a river, hill or valley near you.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 18, 'Get a library card if you don''t have one, or check that yours is still active.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 19, 'Study how your home was heated and lit when it was new, using what you can learn about its era.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 20, 'Show a child in your life a historic spot nearby, with an adult along, and tell them one thing about it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 21, 'Scan the brick walls downtown for a faded painted sign, sometimes called a ghost sign, and guess what it once sold.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 22, 'Read about a tribal nation in your region as it is today, not only in the past, and learn one thing about its present community life.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 23, 'Look for a local history magazine or journal in the library''s periodicals and read one short article.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 24, 'Chat with a neighbor whose home is like yours about any old surprises they''ve found during repairs.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 25, 'Make a tiny guidebook with a child, drawing three nearby places together and writing one sentence about each.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 26, 'Find out which building in your neighborhood is the oldest still standing, then go see it from the sidewalk.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 27, 'Look up whether a tribal nation near you runs a cultural center or museum, and whether it welcomes visitors.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 28, 'Request a look at an old map of your neighborhood in the library''s reference collection.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 29, 'Search old city directories at the library for your address and note who lived there before you.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 30, 'Read a short picture book about your area''s history with a child at bedtime.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 31, 'Research whether your town once had a grand movie theater or opera house, and read about a show that played there.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 32, 'Picture what the land under your town was like before roads and buildings, then read about how people lived on it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 33, 'Find a bird''s eye view drawing of your town from long ago in the library''s collection, and spot a building still standing.'),
