  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 239, 'Gather any old tickets, programs or receipts in your home from local places and keep them in an envelope.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 240, 'Encourage a child to draw a picture of an old building you visited together.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 241, 'Track down a street in your area that was renamed, and learn what it used to be called and why.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 242, 'Honor a veteran from your town, from any era, by reading about the life they came home to.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 243, 'Trace a route that no longer runs on an old train, trolley or bus map of your area.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 244, 'Make a small folder for everything you learn about your home''s history.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 245, 'Keep the photos you take of your changing street in one folder, labeled with places and dates.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 246, 'In autumn, look for a stone or iron fence around an old property and admire the craftsmanship from the sidewalk.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 247, 'Spend some time with the story of an inventor, artist or musician from your area''s past.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 248, 'Check whether a nearby college library has a local history archive open to the public.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 249, 'Identify a plant in your home or yard that came from a relative''s cutting or seeds, and its story.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 250, 'Describe a historic place you love to someone who has never seen it, and notice which details you choose.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 251, 'Read the plaque on a statue or monument in your area and find out who put it there and when.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 252, 'Request a suggestion from your librarian: a local person from history they think more people should know about.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 253, 'Go to a free living history day at a small historic site, if one is offered, and ask one question.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 254, 'Find out whether your street was ever renumbered, using an old directory or map.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 255, 'Spend a winter evening reading a local history story aloud to your household.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 256, 'Consider whose story a local monument tells and whose it leaves out, and how views of it may have changed.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 257, 'Honor the women who worked in local factories, offices or farms during wartime by reading one of their stories.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 258, 'Take a slow summer evening to read a local history blog or column written by someone in your area.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 259, 'Share a memory of this place with a family member over the phone tonight.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 260, 'Learn a short local history story well enough to tell it without notes.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 261, 'Run your eyes over a historic building''s bricks or stones and wonder where the material came from.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 262, 'Dig a little deeper into a local hero named on a plaque, and look for more of the real story behind it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 263, 'Write a few lines in your notebook about which era of your town you''d most like to visit, and why.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 264, 'Recall the first friend you made in this area and where you used to meet.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 265, 'Read back a memory you wrote down to the person who shared it, so they can correct anything.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 266, 'Notice the alleys behind older blocks and wonder what deliveries, stables or workshops once used them.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 267, 'Find out who first lived in the oldest house you know of, and what work they did.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 268, 'Settle in on a quiet morning with an old local almanac, guidebook or travel brochure and see how the town described itself.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 269, 'Remember a big storm, festival or event you lived through here, and note what you recall.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 270, 'Give someone new to the area a list of three free places to learn local history.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 271, 'Locate the place where your town began, often near water or a crossroads, and stand there for a minute.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 272, 'Read a diary, letter or memoir written by someone who lived in your area long ago.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 273, 'Look up the story of a local newspaper itself, including who started it and how it first reached readers.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 274, 'Wonder aloud with a relative which local places from their past they most wish were still around.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 275, 'Contribute to a community memory project at your library, if one exists.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 276, 'Keep an eye out for old flood lines that some towns mark on buildings, and learn about the flood behind them.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 277, 'Picture neighbors long ago raising a barn or sewing a quilt together, then read about how such gatherings worked here.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 278, 'Find a novel or story set in your town or region and read one chapter.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 279, 'Tell a household member about one thing you''ve learned about your home''s past.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 280, 'Suggest a local history book for your book club or a friend''s reading list.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 281, 'Name the oldest business still open in your area and look up the year it opened.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 282, 'Page through an old local cookbook or club booklet and notice the names of the women who made it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 283, 'Search old newspapers for the opening of a building you know, and read what people said about it then.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 284, 'Imagine your home on the day it was finished, with fresh paint and empty rooms.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 285, 'Retell a local legend to a friend, saying where you first heard it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 286, 'Count the steps worn smooth at the entrance of an old public building, and wonder how many feet made those dips.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 287, 'On a spring morning, learn which crops or plants the first peoples of your area grew or gathered.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 288, 'Picture the crowd at an old local election, rally or town meeting as you read an account of it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 289, 'Hunt for a recipe card, note or letter in a relative''s handwriting and keep it somewhere safe.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 290, 'Point out an old detail on a building to a walking companion, like a faded sign or date stone.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 291, 'Tour a historic home that is open to the public and read about how the family who lived there spent their days.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 292, 'Talk with a child in your life about someone from your town''s past, and tell it like a story.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 293, 'Pick one word you didn''t know from an old local document and look up what it meant then.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 294, 'Picture where the nearest market or school stood when your home was new.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 295, 'Take a child, along with another adult if you''re not their parent, to a free story hour about local history.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 296, 'Look up a long gone amusement park, skating rink or dance hall in your area and where it once stood.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 297, 'Use an old census record at the library to see what jobs were common on your street a hundred years ago.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 298, 'Watch a short documentary about your region''s history borrowed from the library.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 299, 'Note one way your family has helped shape this place, however small.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 300, 'Talk with your household about which local places you''d most like to see preserved.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 301, 'Spend a snowy afternoon reading about how people in your town got around in winter long ago, by sleigh, streetcar or on foot.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 302, 'Ask around for the story of a beloved local character from your town''s past whom people still mention fondly.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 303, 'Play a recorded local history talk from your library''s collection during your commute.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 304, 'Name three people who have helped make your home feel like home, past or present.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 305, 'Attend a public meeting, or read the notice, when a historic building in your town faces changes.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 306, 'Spot your town''s water tower or standpipe and read about when it was built and whether it still holds water.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 307, 'Call a friend from another part of the country and compare your hometowns'' histories.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 308, 'Chat with a staff member at a small museum about how the collection began.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 309, 'Spend a quiet spring morning writing what you would tell your home''s first residents about life here now.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 310, 'Sign the guest book at a small museum and write a word of thanks.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 311, 'Uncover where blacksmiths, cobblers or tailors once kept shops on your main street.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 312, 'Notice who is missing from the local stories you have read so far, and look for one of those voices.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 313, 'Think about the oldest object you saw at the museum today and who might have first held it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 314, 'Look for your home on an old map at the library and see what surrounded it then.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 315, 'Drop a postcard of your town in the mail to a faraway friend, with one fact on the back.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 316, 'Compare the street signs in an older part of town with newer ones, and notice any older style or spelling.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 317, 'Seek out a Native community''s own account of the history of your area, written or told by its members.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 318, 'Collect a free pamphlet about your area from the historical society''s front table.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 319, 'Bring two or three family members together to share one memory each of this town.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 320, 'Nominate a local place you love for a community history list or award, if your town has one.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 321, 'Wonder about the weather vane, cupola or clock on an old rooftop nearby, and look up what it was for.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 322, 'Thank a volunteer at your historical society for keeping local stories safe.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 323, 'Admire a mural in a public building, like a post office or library lobby, and read about who painted it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 324, 'Tuck a small notebook by the door to jot down any stories neighbors tell you about your home.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 325, 'Pass along a family story about this place to a younger relative, just as it was told to you.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 326, 'Observe an old row of shops downtown and notice which storefronts still have their original tile entryways or windows.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 327, 'Collect a few words or sayings that people in your region use, and look up where they came from.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 328, 'Explore your library''s online local history collection from home on a cold evening.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 329, 'Keep a family photo of your area on the fridge this autumn as a reminder of where you come from.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 330, 'Lend a hand to a neighbor setting up a block party or street fair, and suggest a little history corner.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 331, 'Bring to mind a building you love in your town, then look up who designed or built it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 332, 'Write a short paragraph about how your own family came to be here, so your story joins the town''s.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 333, 'Jot down three things you learned at the museum before you head home.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 334, 'Trace your daily commute on an old map and see which parts of the route existed back then.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 335, 'Ask a friend which place in town holds a memory for them, and listen closely.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 336, 'Research when streetlights, sidewalks or paved roads first came to your town.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 337, 'Celebrate the lighthouse keepers, mail carriers or switchboard operators who once kept your area connected by reading about one.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 338, 'Revisit a museum or library exhibit you saw before and notice something you missed the first time.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 339, 'Reflect on how your home has sheltered you through good and hard times, and what that means to you.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 340, 'Introduce two neighbors who both love local history so they can swap what they know.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 341, 'Check whether a building near you has a cornerstone time capsule, and read about what was sealed inside.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 342, 'On a fall evening, read about the harvest fairs or gatherings that farm families in your area once held.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 343, 'Scan the community bulletin board at the library for upcoming history events this spring.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 344, 'Choose one room in your home and imagine how earlier residents used it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 345, 'Pause during a spring walk with friends to share what you each love about the neighborhood.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 346, 'Draw a simple map of your neighborhood from memory and mark every old building you have learned about.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 347, 'Write a short list of questions you would love to ask someone who lived here long ago.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 348, 'Read up on how people in your town got the news before radio, from town criers to bulletin boards.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 349, 'Read the deed, lease or welcome papers for your home and notice any old names or boundaries listed.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 350, 'Cheer on a long running parade or community event with a friend, and share what you know of its start.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 351, 'On a rainy afternoon, discover where your town''s first hospital or doctor''s office stood, and what is on that spot today.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 352, 'See whether descendants of an early family still live nearby, and read about them if they have shared their story publicly.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 353, 'Spot an old newspaper ad for a local shop and see whether the building is still standing.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 354, 'Thank a relative who kept family photos or stories about this place safe over the years.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 355, 'Thank the people in your life who first told you stories about this place.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 356, 'Jot a short note about which old place near you you now feel most connected to, and why.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 357, 'Choose the person from your area''s past you would most like to meet, and say why.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 358, 'Sit with an old photograph of your area for a few minutes and imagine the sounds of that street.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 359, 'Describe your neighborhood to a child in your family as you remember it from when you were young.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 360, 'Choose one story you want to keep alive, and decide who you''ll tell it to next.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 361, 'Plan a short walking route that links your favorite historic spots, and share it with a friend or neighbor.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 362, 'Think about the story you are adding to this place, and write one sentence about it.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 363, 'Sit in on a meeting of your local historical society, which is usually open to anyone curious.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 364, 'Save a recording of an older relative''s voice telling how your family came here, with their blessing.'),
  ('getting-to-know-your-local-history', 365, 'Look back on the stories you''ve shared with others, and smile at how they now travel through your community.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
